Renia showed Karak the rooms where he would sleep, chattering about monsters, quests, and the adventures they would have together.
Karak: I need a moment. My chest hurts.
He hid in an empty servants' room. Black smoke rose from his shadow and gathered into a small, watchful spirit.
Grim: I am Grimwell. Grim, if you like. I will always be here, friend. My help has a price, so choose carefully.
[end_timeline]
